aution forces them to consider the evidence.","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-7eff-a502-9106de35aaac","description":"A car designer and driver battle to build a revolutionary race car.","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-7c6d-93b2-1dcf159da48a","category":"01a21312-b489-796c-8b3c-aa437bd658ff","question":"Which 1995 Terry Gilliam film starring Bruce Willis was inspired by the short French film La Jetee?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Twelve Monkeys expands on La Jet\u00e9e, a French science-fiction short told almost entirely through still photographs.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-7f79-9bef-ab3e3791498f","description":"Twelve Monkeys","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-7c19-b993-cea03529be09","description":"Brazil","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-7e06-bc80-998ae75f029a","description":"The Fisher King","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-7ee2-b9b2-b694b6b93776","description":"Time Bandits","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-7af3-9d67-5cf0366acded","category":"01a21312-b489-796c-8b3c-aa437bd658ff","question":"In which year was Back to the Future first released in the cinema?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Back to the Future was first released in 1985 and became the top-grossing film at the North American box office that year.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-7801-a8ab-56f337ff8f6f","description":"1985","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-7c78-8238-9c4e8815a62f","description":"1970","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-7d37-bc80-87ad695f8e8f","description":"1975","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-7261-9e6b-5e1efa8ecc81","description":"1980","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-74c2-a9ef-aa63090df54a","category":"01a21312-b489-796c-8b3c-aa437bd658ff","question":"Which of these quotes is from the film \'Bonnie and Clyde\'?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"\u201cWe rob banks\u201d is the quote from Bonnie and Clyde, the 1967 crime film starring Warren Beatty and Faye Dunaway.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-7c4b-b8ee-3b406ff4ec28","description":"\"We rob banks.\"","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-7575-b60c-183375c9d6a5","description":"\"You can\'t handle the truth!\"","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-7583-bb22-7ce3cb459f53","description":"\"There\'s no place like home.\"","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-7c11-95d5-a37c264880f1","description":"\"Carpe diem. Seize the day, boys. Make your lives extraordinary.\"","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-739c-a959-a599a878a9e2","category":"01a21312-b489-796c-8b3c-aa437bd658ff","question":"Which actor has featured in films including Pulp Fiction and Hairspray?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"In the 2007 film Hairspray, John Travolta played Edna Turnblad, a role often played by a man.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-7f93-a52e-d01bed22585a","description":"John Travolta","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-749c-993c-b12e06bafc42","description":"Ralph Fiennes","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-79a8-ad39-a791cb0edb89","description":"Brian Cox","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-73ff-ae00-9e19f9626e4c","description":"Michael Douglas","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-7615-bff5-acab7ea73793","category":"01a21312-b489-796c-8b3c-aa437bd658ff","question":"In which year was Star Wars: Episode V - The Empire Strikes Back first released in the cinema?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"The Empire Strikes Back was released in 1980 as the second film in the original Star Wars trilogy.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-7e21-98ff-679fc885e16d","description":"1980","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-74e2-bbac-a73b1d936e3c","description":"1965","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-733d-8960-3034219ad7a3","description":"1970","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-70c1-b723-995cede2f7ed","description":"1975","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae14-7ea8-878a-fcae14aa6580",